                        <td style="padding-bottom: 25px;">
                            <h1 style="margin: 0; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 28px; line-height: 36px; color: #111111; font-weight: normal;">
                                Brain Health Expert Exposes the &quot;Evil Protein&quot; Linked to Rapid Cognitive Decline of 175 Million Americans!
                            </h1>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    <tr>
                        <td style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; color: #333333; padding-bottom: 20px;">
                            <p style="margin: 0 0 20px 0;">A renowned brain health expert has just gone public with a discovery that is shaking the medical establishment. Dr. Gupta has identified an &quot;Evil Protein&quot; that is currently attacking the neural pathways of over 175 million Americans.</p>
                            <p style="margin: 0;">This protein is responsible for what we often dismiss as &quot;aging&quot;—the blank-mind moments, forgetting names, and losing focus in the middle of a conversation.</p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

